      },
      "output": "Figure out how many gallons of rain fell on your barn &#8211; Half Hill Farm\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\n\n\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\r\n    \t\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n        \r\n                            \r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                                110 West High Street Woodbury, TN 37190sales@halfhillfarm.com615-469-7778\r\n                                                \r\n                \r\n                            \r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                                Tue - Fri 10 am to 6 pm | Sat - Mon 10 am to 4 pm\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n                                                \r\n                \r\n                    \r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n        \r\n        \t\r\n                                    \r\n                            \r\n            \r\n                \r\n            \r\n        \r\n        \r\n            Home\nAbout Us\nShop Online\nNews &#038; Info\nContact Us\nWholesale\nShop        \r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\r\n    \r\n        \r\n                            \r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                                110 West High Street Woodbury, TN 37190sales@halfhillfarm.com615-469-7778\r\n                                                \r\n                \r\n                            \r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                                Tue - Fri 10 am to 6 pm | Sat - Mon 10 am to 4 pm\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n                                                \r\n                \r\n                    \r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHome\nAbout Us\nShop Online\nNews &#038; Info\nContact Us\nWholesale\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tShop\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\r\n\r\n                           \r\n        \r\n            \r\n                Figure out how many gallons of rain fell on your barn            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n        \r\n        \t\r\n\t\t\t\t                    \r\n    \r\n    \t\r\n            \r\n                \r\n                     Christian Grantham\r\n                     how to, irrigation\r\n                     Comments are off for this post.\r\n                \r\n            \r\n        \r\n                        \t                    \r\n\t\t\t\nIf you&#8217;ve ever wondered how many gallons of rain water fell on your roof or your property, here is some rain math I whipped up this morning to figure it out after a weekend of heavy rain:\n( ______ square feet  X  144 square inches )  X   _____ inches of rain / 231 cubic inches per gallon  =  _______ gallons of rain!\nKnowing how much rain you could collect from a barn or shed roof is important information to know, especially for a farm with irrigation needs. Just like the abundance of free solar energy, rain water is one of those amazing natural resources that literally hits us in the face while we barely even think about it.\nKnowing what natural resources are freely available to you is the first step toward harnessing and managing those resources into more sustainable living. This rain math tells me what size cisterns and pumps I would need. It also shows me how much municipal water we can save and understanding our impact on the Stones River watershed.\n        \r\n        \r\n        \t\r\n\t\t\t\tcalculatecisternconversionconvertfarmgallonsinchesorganicrainrain calculatorStones RiverTennesseewatershedWoodbury            \r\n            \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \t\t\r\n\t\tPost navigation\r\n\r\n\t Using mycorrhizal fungi in organic farmingThe five little winters of Tennessee \r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\r\n\t          \r\n                                    \r\n                        \t    \r\n        \r\n        \r\n    \t\r\n\t   Shop Mushroom Dual Extracts\t   \t   \r\n\t\r\n\r\n \tTurkey Tail Mushroom Dual Extract\r\n \tLion’s Mane Mushroom Dual Extract\r\n \tChaga Mushroom Dual Extract\r\n \tRed Reishi Mushroom Dual Extract\r\n \tCordyceps Mushroom Dual Extract\r\n \tFive Mushroom Dual Extract\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nStay Connected\r\n\r\n \tCALL US: 615-469-7778\r\n \tShop our functional mushroom supplements online\r\n \tFollow us on Facebook\r\n \tFollow us on Instagram\r\n\r\n\r\nRecent PostsMushroom Supplement Serving Size Guide: How Much Should You Take?\n3 Ways Turkey Tail Mushrooms Support Healthy Immune Function\n4 Ways Red Reishi Mushrooms Support a Healthy Stress Response\n4 Ways Lion&#8217;s Mane Mushrooms Support Healthy Cognitive Function\n4 Ways Cordyceps Mushrooms Support Healthy Stamina\n\r\nSearchSearch\t\r\n        \r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\t            \r\n                \r\n                            \r\n\t\t\tWellness Emporium110 West High Street Woodbury, TN 37190(615) 469-7778sales@halfhillfarm.comTuesday - Friday 10am - 6pm | Saturday - Monday 10am - 4pm        \r\n        \r\n                    Shop Functional Mushroom Extracts\t\t\t\nTurkey Tail Mushroom Dual Extract\nLion’s Mane Mushroom Dual Extract\nChaga Mushroom Dual Extract\nRed Reishi Mushroom Dual Extract\nCordyceps Mushroom Dual Extract\nFive Mushroom Dual Extract\n\n\n\t\t\r\n                    Half Hill Farm®\t\t\tStay on your path to Better Health &amp; Well-Being. Shop Half Hill 